00:14:58.321 --> 00:14:59.781
Inilah kebangkitan kita.

00:14:59.864 --> 00:15:01.741
- Ya!
- Ya!

00:15:01.824 --> 00:15:04.702
Kita bubarkan mereka
dengan tembakan senapan.

00:15:04.786 --> 00:15:06.245
Ya!

00:15:06.329 --> 00:15:07.830
- Mantap!
- Ya!

