00:15:36.109 --> 00:15:38.111
Dan rangkulan erat saudara kalian
malam ini.

00:15:38.194 --> 00:15:40.363
- Benar.
- Ya.

00:15:40.446 --> 00:15:42.824
Aku berjanji,
kita akan merayakannya malam ini.

00:15:43.658 --> 00:15:44.659
Tapi pertama-tama...

00:15:48.371 --> 00:15:49.414
