00:15:49.497 --> 00:15:50.498
Ya!

00:15:50.581 --> 00:15:52.959
- Ya!
- Ya!

00:15:53.042 --> 00:15:55.044
...dan kita lepaskan anjing-anjing perang!

00:15:55.128 --> 00:15:59.632
Perang!

00:15:59.715 --> 00:16:02.677
Perang!

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.721
Perang!

00:16:05.805 --> 00:16:07.348
Mari kita berangkat!

00:17:17.877 --> 00:17:21.589
Perang!

